      { text: '“One where the heroine gets to write her own ending.”', delta: 14, note: 'her agency', response: 'Her grin is bright as a match. “Now that’s a book I’d stay up all night to read.”', memory: 'The page she chose' },
      { text: '“Tell me about a story you already love.”', delta: 10, note: 'thoughtful listening', response: 'She tells you about a little paper boat that crossed an ocean. Her voice turns tender at the ending.', memory: 'A story shared' }
